OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with sunny spells. The
OL,7,Fnight will continue dry with clear
OL,8,Fperiods but becoming generally
OL,9,Fcloudier in the south at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FAfter a dry and bright start
OL,12,Fto the morning cloud and patchy rain
OL,13,Fwill spread across from the west,
OL,14,Fturning heavier in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
